without traditional bridge liquidity pools</span></div></div></div></div><div class="card block font-normal group relative my-2 ring-2 ring-transparent rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-background-dark border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="px-6 py-5 relative" data-component-part="card-content-container"><div aria-hidden="true" class="size-6 fill-gray-800 dark:fill-gray-100 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-6" data-component-part="card-icon"><svg class="forced-colors:forced-color-adjust-none forced-colors:bg-[color:CanvasText]! size-6 m-0! shrink-0 bg-primary dark:bg-primary-light" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/regular/gauge-high.svg&quot;);-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/regular/gauge-high.svg&quot;);mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center"></svg></div><div class="w-full"><h2 id="_R_8sljddbsnlhjiuqsnpfiutb_" class="not-prose font-semibold text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white mt-4" contentEditable="false" data-component-part="card-title">Configurable transfer speeds</h2><div id="_R_8sljddbsnlhjiuqsnpfiutbH1_" class="prose mt-1 font-normal text-base leading-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400" data-component-part="card-content"><span data-as="p">Choose between <a class="link" href="/cctp/concepts/finality-and-block-confirmations#fast-transfer-attestation-times">Fast
