osts\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Fees\",\"href\":\"/gateway/references/fees\"},{\"title\":\"Circle Forwarding Service for Gateway\",\"description\":\"Forward destination chain mints to simplify crosschain transfers\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Forwarding Service\",\"href\":\"/gateway/references/forwarding-service\"},{\"group\":\"Quickstarts\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Quickstart: Create and transfer a unified USDC balance on EVM\",\"description\":\"Create and transfer a unified USDC balance on EVM using Circle Gateway.\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Create and transfer a unified USDC balance on EVM\",\"href\":\"/gateway/quickstarts/unified-balance-evm\"},{\"title\":\"Quickstart: Create and transfer a unified USDC balance on Solana\",\"description\":\"Create and transfer a unified USDC balance on Solana using Circle Gateway.\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Create and transfer a unified USDC balance on Solana\",\"href\":\"/gateway/quickstarts/unified-balance-solana\"},{\"title\":\"Quickstart: Gasless Gateway deposits with Eco\",\"description\":\"Deposit testnet USDC into Circle Gateway without paying source-chain gas by using Eco's gasless deposit flow.\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Gasless Gateway deposits with Eco\",\"href\":\"/gateway/quickstarts/eco-gasless-deposits\"},{\"title\":\"How-to: Transfer with the Forwarding Service\",\"description\":\"Transfer USDC crosschain using the Forwarding Service to automatically handle destination chain minting\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Transfer with the Forwarding Service\",\"href\":\"/gateway/howtos/forwarding-service\"}]}]},{\"group\":\"Transfer from a unified balance\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"How-to: Create a unified USDC balance\",\"description\":null,\"sidebarTitle\":\"Create a unified USDC balance\",\"href\":\"/gateway/howtos/create-unified-usdc-balance\"},{\"title\":\"How-to: Transfer a unified USDC balance instantly\",\"description\":null,\"sidebarTitle\":\"Transfer a unified USDC balance\",\"href\":\"/gateway/howtos/transfer-unified-usdc-balance\"},{\"title\":\"How-to: Manage delegates for Gateway transfers\",\"description\":\"Add or remove delegate accounts that can authorize Gateway transfers on behalf of a depositor.\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Manage delegates\",\"href\":\"/gateway/howtos/manage-delegates\"},{\"title\":\"How-to: Transfer USDC from a smart contract account\",\"description\":\"Sign a Gateway burn intent with a Circle smart contract account and transfer a unified USDC balance using ERC-1271 programmable authorization.\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Transfer from a SCA\",\"href\":\"/gateway/howtos/transfer-with-erc-1271\"}]},{\"group\":\"Webhooks\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Gateway webhooks\",\"description\":\"Get Gateway event updates for your registered wallet addresses.\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Webhooks overview\",\"href\":\"/gateway/webhooks\"},{\"title\":\"Gateway webhook events\",\"description\":\"Reference for Gateway webhook event types, payload schemas, and example notifications.\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Webhook events\",\"href\":\"/gateway/references/webhook-events\"}]},{\"group\":\"Nanopayments\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Nanopayments\",\"description\":\"Gas-free USDC nanopayments down to $0.000001, powered by Circle Gateway batched settlement\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Nanopayments Overview\",\"href\":\"/gateway/nanopayments\"},{\"title\":\"What is x402?\",\"description\":\"An overview of the x402 open payment standard and how Nanopayments provides a gasless payment method for x402-protected resources\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"What is x402?\",\"href\":\"/gateway/nanopayments/concepts/x402\"},{\"title\":\"How batched settlement works\",\"description\":\"How Circle Gateway aggregates payment authorizations and settles them onchain in a single transaction\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Batched settlement\",\"href\":\"/gateway/nanopayments/concepts/batched-settlement\"},{\"group\":\"Quickstarts\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Quickstart: Pay for resources with nanopayments\",\"description\":\"Deposit USDC into Gateway and make gasless payments to x402-protecte